# CLI emit commands default to writing these to the cwd when run without
# -o/--output (sdlc-evidence vex -> openvex.json, statement -> statement.intoto.json,
# guac -> guac.json, sarif -> gaps.sarif). Root-anchored so they are ignored only as
# repo-root scratch, never test fixtures. `guac.json` was missing from this list and
# a scratch run from the repo root got it committed.
/openvex.json
/statement.intoto.json
/guac.json
/gaps.sarif

